 "When must workers doing construction safety assessment be trained, and under which table?",
 ["Beforehand, on the construction safety assessor training; courses and hours follow Table 5","Within three months of taking the post, on that training; courses and hours follow Table 6","Beforehand, on the process safety assessor training; courses and hours follow Table 6 rules","Beforehand, on construction industry supervisor training; courses and hours follow Table 2"],
